    'Aurelia felt lonely after 13 hours without Mina.\\n'
    'Calmed down after a message arrived at 11:47 PM.\\n'
    'Reviewed the refactor changes multiple times (overchecking).\\n'
    'Marker: LOG-MARKER-APR29\\n',
